],"flavourText":"Soldier played by a Minoan citizen. Even ordinary soldiers have a chance to become heroes. The most important thing is to have the courage and resilience to pick up the sword when the javelin is broken.","abilities":["Becomes melee if ranged attack misses"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":4200,"atk":360,"def":100,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}},"comedic_poet":{"slug":"comedic_poet","name":"Comedic Poet","icon":"/enemies-icons/Comedic Poet.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"An aoidos on the streets of Minos, singing stories of mirth. The aoidos tradition predates the nation of Minos, and as the predecessor to Minoan drama, endures to this day.","abilities":["Draws and absorbs water from Fountains, summoning <Heroic Ideal> when complete"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":600,"def":150,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}},"questioning_statue":{"slug":"questioning_statue","name":"Questioning Statue","icon":"/enemies-icons/Questioning Statue.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Once an ordinary sculpture found on the streets of Minos, inspired by a legendary monster who blocks roads and makes travelers answer riddles. The creative citizens of Minos have built drones in their image to carry out simple tasks such as carrying water and watering flowers.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Lands when passing over a Fountain without a statue","Fountains it lands on cannot be healed and continuously lose water","Leaves the battlefield after spending a certain amount of time on a Fountain"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.75,"stats":{"hp":6000,"atk":450,"def":600,"res":50,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"heroic_ideal":{"slug":"heroic_ideal","name":"Heroic Ideal","icon":"/enemies-icons/Heroic Ideal.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An illusion created by the stories of the aoidoi. Heroic ideals come in a million forms—some are grand, others simple.","abilities":["Not affected by Immersed","Dodges Physical and Arts damage from your non-Immersed units"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":22000,"atk":1100,"def":330,"res":50,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"xanthos_the_avenger":{"slug":"xanthos_the_avenger","name":"Xanthos, the Avenger","icon":"/enemies-icons/Xanthos, the Avenger.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Come what may, he will stand before the Sargonians and his own people, with nothing to hide, and ask his question of them, here and now.","abilities":["Attacks hit 3 times","[Question] Gains greatly increased Movement Speed when unblocked for 10s","[Dried Waterway] When unblocked, DEF and RES are greatly increased, and ATK gradually increases (reaches max after 10s)","[Imagination of Ruin] Every attack reduces the ATK gain from [Dried Waterway]","[Recurring Grudge] Summons <'Ithakos Innumerable'> when defeated for the first time, then gains greatly increased HP, and attacks deal Physical splash damage; [Imagination of Ruin] becomes disabled","When <'Ithakos Innumerable'> is defeated, takes True damage equal to its Max HP and becomes stunned; [Dried Waterway] is disabled"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":90000,"atk":1200,"def":800,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.6}},"ithakos_innumerable":{"slug":"ithakos_innum